BEGIN_DESC
ORION-class torch ship. Cold and dark in a 185 km parking orbit.

STARTUP (keyboard, temporary until the 2D panel exists):
  1 = arm all three battery banks
  2 = close INV 1 + AVIONICS + LIFE SUPPORT
  3 = coolant PUMP 1   <-- BEFORE the reactor, or it scrams in 30 s
  4 = START REACTOR A  (PUMPDOWN > FIELD > HEAT > IGNITE > ASCENT > ONLINE, ~5 min)
  5 = close GEN A + ESS FEED  (reactor now carries the ship; banks recharge)
  6 = close DRIVE CTL  <-- the torch will not fire without this
  + / -  throttle

Watch the reactor come up on the debug string (bottom-left corner text,
visible automatically once populated -- Ctrl+F1 opens the camera dialog
in this build, not a debug toggle).
END_DESC

BEGIN_ENVIRONMENT
  System Sol
  Date MJD 51982.9
END_ENVIRONMENT

BEGIN_FOCUS
  Ship Orion-1
END_FOCUS

BEGIN_CAMERA
  TARGET Orion-1
  MODE Extern
  POS 3.0 -20.00 40.00
  TRACKMODE TargetRelative
  FOV 50.00
END_CAMERA

BEGIN_SHIPS
Orion-1:Orion
  STATUS Orbiting Earth
  ELEMENTS 6556000 0.0001 51.6 0 0 0 51982.9
  AROT 0.00 0.00 0.00
  AFCMODE 7
  PRPLEVEL 0:1.000 1:1.000
END_SHIPS
